From 57a4c495b4626c382a2c34af60ef05b19d56522a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 15:52:52 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Remove link in bio completely

The public /bio/{slug} page, the WordPress page of D15 (App\Bio, WordPressController,
the box on the client form, its routes and texts) are gone. A migration deletes the
stored WordPress application passwords. Decision D19.
